      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am afraid this won\u0027t work for Google-signed APEXes. The APEX module name that you are extracting from the /apex/... path doesn\u0027t always match package name, e.g. google signed ART module will have packageName com.google.android.art.apex, while the path here will refer to /apex/com.android.art.\n\nOne way to solve this would be to add new ApexManager.isTestApex(String apexModuleName) API. The downside is that we currently don\u0027t store the moduleName -\u003e packageName mapping (we only store the packageName -\u003e moduleName one), so you will probably need to create a reverse mapping.",
